# Component Architecture Rules
- Strictly follow the project folder structure inside `/components`.
- Never create or leave section files directly in `/components/home/` or `/components/common/` if a dedicated folder exists.
- Home page sections must be placed strictly inside their respective subfolders:
  - Hero -> `components/home/heroSection/`
  - Categories -> `components/home/category/`
  - Offers & Banners -> `components/home/offers/`
  - Featured & Testimonials -> `components/home/theBest/`
- Generic shared layout components belong to `components/common/`, while standalone global sections like Footer have their own folder `components/footer/`.
- Always update relative imports when moving or generating components.

